 ~\\~\nSlow down and reconnect through a calming meditation practice that s
 upports mental clarity\, relaxation\, and emotional wellbeing. Classes may
  incorporate breath awareness\, mindfulness\, visualization\, or other med
 itative techniques to encourage presence and inner calm. Suitable for all 
 experience levels.\nFollowing\, immerse yourself in a deeply restorative e
 xperience that uses healing sound vibrations and frequencies to promote re
 laxation and inner calm. Guests are invited to rest comfortably while allo
 wing the soothing sounds of sound bowls to wash over them. Perfect for any
 one looking to slow down\, unwind\, and profoundly reset.\n\\~\\~\\~\\~\\~
 \\~\n\nSingle class pass: $20\nBuy 5 get 1 free: $100\nMonthly Unlimited W
 ellness Membership: $125 (includes tons of other perks!)\n\n* Unlimited we
 llness classes\n* 15% off retail purchases\n* 10% off Eminence skincare pr
 oducts\n* 15% off facial services\n* $20 off massage services\n* A birthda
 y month home skincare package\n* Rotating quarterly member-exclusive benef
 its\nMonthly Unlimited Founder's Membership: $100 (same perks as Wellness\
 ; offer available until July 15)\n\nWalk in's welcome or [Book Online](htt
 ps://urbanoasisasheville.com/classes/)
